# Festag — dark-mode CTAs (Forest Intelligence)

Dark CTAs match the pre-neon look: quiet idle, soft cool-white ready, **full pills**.

## Geometry

```css
--festag-auth-radius: 999px; /* pills everywhere */
--festag-control-radius: 999px;
```

## Idle (empty / invalid / not ready)

```css
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
color: #C7D0CC;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
border-radius: 999px;
```

## Ready / portal primary

Soft cool-white — as before, never neon blue:

```css
background: #F0F2F5;
color: #1A1A1E;
border: 1px solid transparent;
border-radius: 999px;
box-shadow: none;
```

Hover `#DCE1E8` / active `#CFD5DD`.

Brand accent slate `#5B647D` stays for focus strokes / Google SSO / links — not for primary fill.

## Do not

- Electric / neon blues as CTA fills
- Colored glow shadows
- Compact 8–14px rect buttons when pills are intended
